) solution designed to empower hundreds of BMW DevOps teams to streamline their infrastructure optimization efforts. The ICCA solution harnesses the power of generative artificial intelligence (GenAI) on AWS to provide real-time insights and recommendations that help accelerate the identification and resolution of performance bottlenecks, resource optimization opportunities, cost-saving measures and more.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/BMWGroup_logo_200x70_1X.3445718b3f949f158f9e3cac77d3ee79d4767a7f.jpg","displayLocation":"Other","customerNameLower":"bmw group","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2024-03-15","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/industries/bmw-group-develops-a-genai-assistant-to-accelerate-infrastructure-optimization-on-aws/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"BMW Group","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"BMW Group Develops a GenAI Assistant to Accelerate Infrastructure Optimization on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-enablement#support","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-enablement","name":"AWS Support","description":"AWS Support","dateCreated":"2020-09-04T04:06:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#other","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Other","description":"Other","dateCreated":"2021-07-30T05:52:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:59+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Mobile","description":"Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-22T20:28:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#